<h2 class="ds-section-title">How it starts</h2>

<ol class="consulting-steps">
  <li class="consulting-step">
    <span class="consulting-step-number">01</span>
    <h3 class="consulting-step-title">Talk</h3>
    <p>
      You tell us what the agent does well and where it wastes your day. We tell you if we are the right two people for
      it.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="consulting-step">
    <span class="consulting-step-number">02</span>
    <h3 class="consulting-step-title">Audit</h3>
    <p>
      A fixed scope and a quote before we start. We read, we run, we write it down. You keep the findings whether or not
      we ever work together again.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li class="consulting-step">
    <span class="consulting-step-number">03</span>
    <h3 class="consulting-step-title">Change, then measure again</h3>
    <p>
      We make the changes with you, or you make them from our notes. Then we run the same measurement as the audit, so
      the difference is yours to keep and to argue about.
    </p>
  </li>
</ol>

